OL,3,AUK to explore even closer ties with EU
OL,4,Aafter agreeing deal, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said the UK will discuss
OL,7,Fpossible options for even closer ties
OL,8,Fwith the EU, after agreeing a deal
OL,9,Fcovering British food exports,
OL,10,Femissions trading and a youth
OL,11,Fexperience scheme.
OL,13,FThe prime minister said it was a "good
OL,14,Fday" for Britain and Europe, adding the
OL,15,FTreasury believes the deal could boost
OL,16,Fthe UK economy by up to #17bn a year.
OL,18,FEuropean Council President Antonio
OL,19,FCosta said the EU remains "open to have
OL,20,Fthe closest possible relationship" with
OL,21,Fthe UK.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
