OL,3,AUK to explore even closer ties with EU
OL,4,Aafter agreeing deal, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch said
OL,7,Fthe deal "isn't fair" - and Reform's
OL,8,FNigel Farage called it a "betrayal of
OL,9,Fthe British people".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
