OL,3,ARussian missile hits Poland as
OL,4,AUkraine's allies hold military
OL,5,Aexercise, says Tusk
OL,6,
OL,7,FPoland says a Russian cruise missile
OL,8,Fwas among three objects that violated
OL,9,Fits airspace early on Friday, with
OL,10,FPrime Minister Donald Tusk saying it
OL,11,Fdid not appear to be an accident when
OL,12,FWestern military exercises were taking
OL,13,Fplace in the region.
OL,15,FNobody was hurt and no damage has been
OL,16,Freported, but Warsaw described the
OL,17,Fincident as a "provocation" from
OL,18,FMoscow.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
