OL,3,AFrench police officers sentenced for
OL,4,Abeating of music producer Michel Zecler
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree French police officers have been
OL,7,Fconvicted of beating up a black music
OL,8,Fproducer six years ago in Paris in what
OL,9,Fthe court upheld as an aggravated
OL,10,Fcircumstance of racism.
OL,12,FThe three were also found guilty of
OL,13,Fsigning a falsified police report
OL,14,Fstating that the producer - Michel
OL,15,FZecler, 47 - had violently resisted
OL,16,Ftheir attempt to arrest him.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
